Vendored robot assets
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Robot scenes and meshes under assets/mjcf/ are vendored from MuJoCo
Menagerie (https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie) and
related upstream sources. Each model retains its original LICENSE file
alongside it (Apache-2.0 / BSD-3-Clause / MIT, per model). SO-ARM101
assets derive from the LeRobot project (Apache-2.0).
